(DTD Battleground is a working, single-event quiz platform for the JNTUH Data Science) Tj
T*
(Club. It supports team registration and login, three quiz rounds, an organiser) Tj
T*
(dashboard, a live display, server-authoritative scoring, question secrecy, backups, and) Tj
T*
(persistent state.) Tj
