T*
(A k6 ramp to 1,000 virtual users polling /api/state completed with 0% HTTP failures.) Tj
T*
(Results included p95 2.77 ms and p99 5.21 ms. This validates the lightweight public) Tj
T*
(polling path on the test laptop.) Tj
