(### Registration burst before hardening) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The initial 150-VU repeated-registration test caused multi-second delays and occasional) Tj
T*
(failures. The main causes were synchronous scryptSync password hashing and synchronous) Tj
T*
(full-state disk writes on the Node event loop.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Registration burst after hardening) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The 150-VU repeated-registration test achieved:) Tj
T*
(- 1,639 successful registrations in about 31.4 seconds \(52.26 registrations/second\).) Tj
T*
(- 0% registration failures and 0% HTTP failures.) Tj
T*
(- Registration p95: 1.61 seconds.) Tj
T*
(- Polling p95 while registrations were running: 786 ms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This is about 3x the successful registration throughput of the prior implementation. It) Tj
T*
(remains an intentionally harsher workload than event check-in because every virtual user) Tj
T*
(continually creates new teams; the run created more than 1,600 fake teams.) Tj
