(Implemented improvements:) Tj
T*
(- HTTP registration and login now use asynchronous crypto.scrypt\(\) with await, so) Tj
T*
(hashing runs in Node's worker pool rather than freezing timers and polling on the event) Tj
T*
(loop.) Tj
T*
(- State persistence is coalesced for 250 ms and serialized. There is at most one disk) Tj
T*
(write in flight and one dirty-state flag; requests do not create an unbounded write) Tj
