(queue.) Tj
T*
(- Each persistence operation writes a unique temporary file and atomically renames it to) Tj
T*
(state.json.) Tj
T*
(- Shutdown handling flushes pending persistence before normal process exit.) Tj
T*
(- The HTTP request boundary now returns HTTP 400 for malformed request URLs rather than) Tj
T*
(crashing the request handler.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
